feat(ai): add new models, xhigh reasoning effort, and Anthropic structured output fix

- Anthropic: move structured output from output_format to output_config.format;
  strip unsupported validation keywords (min/max, minLength, pattern, etc.) and
  collapse multi-type arrays to permissive object in schema cleaner
- Gemini: add Gemini31FlashImage, Gemini31FlashTTS, NanoBanana2, GeminiRoboticsER16
  models; mark Gemini 1.5 Flash 002 and 1.5 Flash 8B deprecated (2026-06-01);
  add file-search retrievedContext citations (mediaId, pageNumbers)
- OpenAI: add xhigh reasoning effort level across chat and responses APIs;
  add GPT-5.5, GPT-5.5 Pro, GPT Audio 1.5, GPT Realtime 1.5, GPT Realtime Translate;
  add phase field to responses output message; export axNormalizeOpenAIUsage
- types: add isDeprecated/deprecatedOn to AxModelInfo; add mediaId/pageNumbers to AxCitation
- Export AxDateRange, AxDateRangeValue from public index

